    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34034" root="فض" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَضٌّ</span></b> , (K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَضٌّ مِنَ النَّاسِ</span>, (O, TA,) <i>A
small number of men</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَفَرٌ</span>) <i>in a state of dispersion.</i>
(O, K, TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمْرٌ فَضٌّ</span> <i>Dates in a separate
state, not sticking together.</i> (IAar. [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَثٌّ</span>.]) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَرِيرٌ فَضٌّ</span> <i>Silk scattered, strewn,</i> or
<i>thrown dispersedly.</i> (A, TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَضَضٌ</span>,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُضَاضٌ</span>.]

